eplace inline colors\n- `src/components/report/visualizations/TrustRadar.tsx` - replace inline colors\n- `src/components/report/visualizations/ConfidenceHeatmap.tsx` - replace inline colors\n- `src/components/report/visualizations/ContradictionMatrix.tsx` - replace inline colors\n- `src/components/report/visualizations/NetworkGraph.tsx` - replace inline colors\n- `src/components/report/visualizations/SourceNetwork.tsx` - replace inline colors\n- `src/components/report/visualizations/EntityConstellation.tsx` - replace inline colors\n- Create new: `src/components/report/visualizations/theme.ts`\n\n## Success Criteria\n- [ ] No inline `isRadar ? x : y` color patterns in visualization components\n- [ ] All visualizations use semantic theme tokens\n- [ ] Adding a new theme requires only theme.ts changes\n- [ ] TypeScript enforces all tokens are defined per theme\n\n## Potential Challenges\n- Ensuring all edge cases are covered by semantic tokens - mitigate with comprehensive audit first\n- Migration may temporarily break visual consistency - mitigate with component-by-component refactor\nDIRECTION_EOF\necho \"Direction 1 content written\""}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":418,"cache_read_input_tokens":105361,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":418},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"56368c58-f692-49c5-b162-eafa9c314a50","uuid":"08cfbbb7-142f-46fe-8ab0-b9482d267ac6"}
