[2026-01-30T09:11:55.977Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SgEM2ctQ5w8bruNcMmsR5R","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  success: true,\n  direction: {\n    id: 'direction_7492314c-3151-4642-bec7-a1d1e016b5dd',\n    project_id: 'b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829',\n    context_map_id: 'group_1769727411820_9razuf0',\n    context_map_title: 'Data Visualizations',\n    direction: '## Vision\\n' +\n      \"Extract shared visualization theme logic into a centralized theme configuration system that eliminates repetitive `isRadar ? 'radar-color' : 'swiss-color'` patterns across 15+ components. This will reduce code duplication, ensure visual consistency, and make theme extensions (adding new themes) trivial.\\n\" +\n      '\\n' +\n      '## Business Value\\n' +\n      '- Reduces code duplication by ~40% across visualization components\\n' +\n      '- Makes adding new themes a single-file change instead of touching 15+ files\\n' +\n      '- Eliminates subtle visual inconsistencies between components\\n' +\n      '- Improves developer experience when building new visualizations\\n' +\n      '\\n' +\n      '## Scope\\n' +\n      '**Included:**\\n' +\n      '- Create unified theme configuration with semantic color tokens\\n' +\n      '- Refactor existing visualization components to use theme tokens\\n' +\n      '- Create theme-aware utility components for common patterns\\n' +\n      '\\n' +\n      '**Excluded:**\\n' +\n      '- Video playback system (already well-abstracted)\\n' +\n      '- Report core components (separate concern)\\n' +\n      '\\n' +\n      '## Key Components\\n' +\n      '1. `ThemeTokens` configuration - defines semantic colors per theme\\n' +\n      '2. `useVisualizationTheme` hook - provides theme-aware color getters\\n' +\n      '3. Theme-aware styled primitives for common SVG/div patterns\\n' +\n      '\\n' +\n      '## Technical Approach\\n' +\n      '1. Audit all visualization files for repeated color patterns\\n' +\n      '2. Create semantic token system (primary, secondary, accent, muted, etc.)\\n' +\n      '3. Build useVisualizationTheme hook with type-safe color accessors\\n' +\n      '4. Refactor components one-by-one to use new system\\n' +\n      '5. Add validation to ensure all tokens are defined per theme\\n' +\n      '\\n' +\n      '## Files to Modify\\n' +\n      '- `src/components/report/visualizations/Timeline.tsx` - replace inline colors\\n' +\n      '- `src/components/report/visualizations/CausalFlow.tsx` - replace inline colors\\n' +\n      '- `src/components/report/visualizations/TrustRadar.tsx` - replace inline colors\\n' +\n      '- `src/components/report/visualizations/ConfidenceHeatmap.tsx` - replace inline colors\\n' +\n      '- `src/components/report/visualizations/ContradictionMatrix.tsx` - replace inline colors\\n' +\n      '- `src/components/report/visualizations/NetworkGraph.tsx` - replace inline colors\\n' +\n      '- `src/components/report/visualizations/SourceNetwork.tsx` - replace inline colors\\n' +\n      '- `src/components/report/visualizations/EntityConstellation.tsx` - replace inline colors\\n' +\n      '- Create new: `src/components/report/visualizations/theme.ts`\\n' +\n      '\\n' +\n      '## Success Criteria\\n' +\n      '- [ ] No inline `isRadar ? x : y` color patterns in visualization components\\n' +\n      '- [ ] All visualizations use semantic theme tokens\\n' +\n      '- [ ] Adding a new theme requires only theme.ts changes\\n' +\n      '- [ ] TypeScript enforces all tokens are defined per theme\\n' +\n      '\\n' +\n      '## Potential Challenges\\n' +\n      '- Ensuring all edge cases are covered by semantic tokens - mitigate with comprehensive audit first\\n' +\n      '- Migration may temporarily break visual consistency - mitigate with component-by-component refactor\\n',\n    summary: 'Consolidate visualization theme system to eliminate repetitive color patterns across 8+ components',\n    status: 'pending'