oach\\n' +\n      '1. Identify repeated patterns in current Scenes.tsx\\n' +\n      '2. Create shared primitives for header and container patterns\\n' +\n      '3. Extract each scene function to its own file\\n' +\n      '4. Create animation presets for common spring configurations\\n' +\n      '5. Update barrel exports in scenes/index.tsx\\n' +\n      '6. Verify visual parity with before/after comparison\\n' +\n      '\\n' +\n      '## Files to Modify\\n' +\n      '- Split: `src/components/report/video/Scenes.tsx` into:\\n' +\n      '  - `src/components/report/video/scenes/TitleScene.tsx`\\n' +\n      '  - `src/components/report/video/scenes/MetricsScene.tsx`\\n' +\n      '  - `src/components/report/video/scenes/ChartsScene.tsx`\\n' +\n      '  - `src/components/report/video/scenes/InsightsScene.tsx`\\n' +\n      '  - `src/components/report/video/scenes/SummaryScene.tsx`\\n' +\n      '  - `src/components/report/video/scenes/primitives.tsx`\\n' +\n      '- Update: `src/components/report/video/index.tsx` exports\\n' +\n      '\\n' +\n      '## Success Criteria\\n' +\n      '- [ ] Each scene is in its own file under 100 lines\\n' +\n      '- [ ] Shared primitives are extracted and reused\\n' +\n      '- [ ] Visual output is identical before and after refactor\\n' +\n      '- [ ] No breaking changes to existing VideoOverview integration\\n' +\n      '\\n' +\n      '## Potential Challenges\\n' +\n      '- Ensuring animation timing stays consistent - mitigate with visual regression testing\\n' +\n      '- Circular dependencies between primitives and scenes - mitigate with careful module structure\\n',\n    summary: 'Decompose 633-line Scenes.tsx into focused scene components with shared animation primitives',\n    status: 'pending',\n    requirement_id: null,\n    requirement_path: null,\n    created_at: '2026-01-30T09:11:56.915Z',\n    updated_at: '2026-01-30T09:11:56.915Z',\n    context_id: null,\n    context_name: 'Data Visualizations',\n    context_group_id: 'group_1